OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe odd
OL,6,Fshower is possible in northern
OL,7,Fcounties this evening, but most places
OL,8,Fwill stay dry with increasingly
OL,9,Fprolonged clear periods overnight.
OL,10,FWinds easing, and turning rather cool
OL,11,Fin some rural spots.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FAny showers in the north
OL,14,Fsoon clearing. Thereafter a dry day
OL,15,Fwith sunny periods. Still a little
OL,16,Fbreezy but much less windy than on
OL,17,FFriday. Warm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
