OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FAny
OL,6,Fshowers clearing on Sunday, then sunny
OL,7,Fspells and feeling much warmer.
OL,8,FPerhaps a little rain overnight, then
OL,9,Flargely dry on Monday. Windier on
OL,10,FTuesday with rain or showers possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
